NOTE ON SOURCE DATA: The underlying natural gas consumption figures
originate from the Petroleum Planning & Analysis Cell (PPAC), Ministry of
Petroleum & Natural Gas, Government of India (https://ppac.gov.in). PPAC
publishes this as open government data. Any use of this dataset should
credit PPAC as the original source in addition to this repository.
